{
  "$comment": "示例：拷到项目根 .grok/lsp.json 并按实际语言删改（本 $comment 键会被忽略，建议删除）。语言服务需自行安装并在 PATH 可用。被动诊断有此文件即生效；主动 lsp 工具需 GROK_LSP_TOOLS=1 或用户 config.toml 设 [features] lsp_tools = true。repo 级 LSP 受文件夹信任约束（/hooks-trust）。",
  "typescript": {
    "command": "typescript-language-server",
    "args": ["--stdio"],
    "extensionToLanguage": {
      ".ts": "typescript",
      ".tsx": "typescriptreact",
      ".js": "javascript",
      ".jsx": "javascriptreact"
    },
    "startupTimeout": 30000
  },
  "rust": {
    "command": "rust-analyzer",
    "extensionToLanguage": { ".rs": "rust" },
    "startupTimeout": 60000
  },
  "python": {
    "command": "pyright-langserver",
    "args": ["--stdio"],
    "extensionToLanguage": { ".py": "python" },
    "startupTimeout": 30000
  }
}
